window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The Silver Mountain, a legendary realm of unimaginable wealth, stands as an alluring enigma, cloaked in myth and intrigue. Its towering peak dominate the landscape, casting a long, imposing shadow over the barren valley below, an endless stretch of sand and stone. Surrounding the mountain is the Forbidden Forest, a place of quiet wonder, its ancient trees draped in an almost ethereal presence. At the heart of the forest, a massive Ivory Tree rises, its towering trunk and radiant leaves standing in stark contrast to the shadows around it. The forest’s hidden demons move in the darkness, guarding their domain with an unsettling vigilance. For generations, fearless adventurers have attempted to conquer the perilous mountain pass or brave the forest’s mysterious paths, only to meet a grim fate, their cries lost to the wind. Yet, from places unknown, a brilliant light bursts forth, shining with an intensity that defies belief, calling to those daring enough to seek its secrets.</p>"; 
